": "mvo2dcpwh3jeoev7vpr", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 3496, "width": 471.3656921386719, "height": 202.5, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 1, "fontSize": 18, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "aK", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "• REPAYING repeats every Thursday until debt = 0.\n• Anyone can repay early, from any wallet.\n• An Advance only reaches LIQUIDATING after\n   8 Thursdays of zero repayment AND a\n   value-based health below 1.\n• A Credit Line can be liquidated any time\n   its health factor drops below 1.\n• Only the PositionNFT holder can close\n   the loan and take the lock back.", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 685309397, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "• REPAYING repeats every Thursday until debt = 0.\n• Anyone can repay early, from any wallet.\n• An Advance only reaches LIQUIDATING after\n   8 Thursdays of zero repayment AND a\n   value-based health below 1.\n• A Credit Line can be liquidated any time\n   its health factor drops below 1.\n• Only the PositionNFT holder can close\n   the loan and take the lock back.", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1792947033004, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 727451707, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "9kiQfDpRKqtWDwJrpx-Yz", "type": "text", "x": 106.50003051757812, "y": 3200, "width": 66.99993896484375, "height": 50, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": "t0", "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 1, "fontSize": 20, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "aL", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "Lock in\nwallet", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 1316220149, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "tex